The most important pattern to remember is:

Grid + simultaneous spreading + minimum time = Multi-Source BFS.

This pattern also appears in other problems involving distance from multiple sources, including 01 Matrix, Walls and Gates, As Far from Land as Possible, and nearest-source grid problems.
